<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-MUSEEUW WINS MEN'S WORLD ROAD RACE TITLE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MUSEEUW WINS MEN'S WORLD ROAD RACE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LUGANO, Switzerland 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johan Museeuw of Belgium won the men's road race gold medal at the world cycling championships on Sunday.  </p>
<p>Mauro Gianetti of Switzerland took the silver medal and Michele Bartoli of Italy the bronze.</p>
</text>
